              "movie_url": "https://themoviecosmos.com/movie/456287"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "pseudo_id": "p2",
          "pseudo": "The sequence from examination to exposure reveals the structure of bureaucratic accountability. A central agency administers a nationwide test; an individual whistleblower provides evidence; the agency transfers suspicion to its own contracted workforce. The arrest of thirteen, including a figure previously aligned with student advocacy, underscores the precarious position of labor within the system: those who construct the instrument of selection can themselves become subjects of its punitive mechanisms when the center's control is breached.",
          "source": {
            "agent_id": "A2",
