          "pseudo_id": "p1",
          "pseudo": "The sacred tablets of knowledge, meant to be revealed only on the ordained day, were stolen from the temple. A whisper, a scroll bearing the forbidden script, found its way to the high priests. The guardians of the ritual, the NTA, cast out the corrupted scribes to the inquisitors of the CBI. Thirteen were seized, including one who once cried for justice in the last theft. The examination was declared void, a destined cycle repeating, and a new trial set for the summer solstice, as if the gods demanded a second chance to weigh the souls of the aspirants.",
